    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, the secrets<i> within</i> the pyramids have captivated imaginations, but the mysteries<i> beneath</i> have remained hidden...until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling journey beneath the Great Pyramids of Giza, where ancient secrets and hidden treasures await. In this immersive puzzle-adventure game, you will explore a labyrinth of tunnels and chambers buried deep beneath the desert sands. Each step forward brings new challenges, from deciphering cryptic symbols to unlocking intricate mechanical doors and treasure chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the underground maze, you\u2019ll encounter mysterious artifacts, each holding a piece of the past. Some may offer clues, while others could be keys to unlocking deeper mysteries. But be warned\u2014these ancient corridors are designed to challenge the mind, testing your ability to solve puzzles and uncover long-lost secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning environments inspired by real Egyptian history and mythology, every chamber tells a story. Will you be the one to unlock the final secret hidden beneath the pyramids? Prepare to enter a world where intelligence and curiosity are your greatest tools, and the reward is a discovery that has remained buried for millennia.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 treasure chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 mysterious artifacts</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, the secrets<i> within</i> the pyramids have captivated imaginations, but the mysteries<i> beneath</i> have remained hidden...until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling journey beneath the Great Pyramids of Giza, where ancient secrets and hidden treasures await. In this immersive puzzle-adventure game, you will explore a labyrinth of tunnels and chambers buried deep beneath the desert sands. Each step forward brings new challenges, from deciphering cryptic symbols to unlocking intricate mechanical doors and treasure chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the underground maze, you\u2019ll encounter mysterious artifacts, each holding a piece of the past. Some may offer clues, while others could be keys to unlocking deeper mysteries. But be warned\u2014these ancient corridors are designed to challenge the mind, testing your ability to solve puzzles and uncover long-lost secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning environments inspired by real Egyptian history and mythology, every chamber tells a story. Will you be the one to unlock the final secret hidden beneath the pyramids? Prepare to enter a world where intelligence and curiosity are your greatest tools, and the reward is a discovery that has remained buried for millennia.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 treasure chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 mysterious artifacts</p></li></ul>",
